# A name with no source is refused at its read, after the effects that stand before it: the refusal is 3 and the dump shows seen 5, after 0.
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
@: shared data[0]
sub: main ()
    int: t 0
    shared\Observed\seen := 5
    t := nosuch(1)
    shared\Observed\after := 6
main()
